.next/
# Heavy, regenerable build artifacts stay out of git (rebuild via the scripts):
#   the SQLite DBs, raw Overture parquet, and intermediate region CSVs.
data/*.sqlite
data/*.sqlite-*
data/*.parquet
data/region_places.parquet
data/region_leads.csv
data/Monday_Call_Sheet.xlsx
data/warm_leads.csv
# The committed deliverables (CSV/JSONL/xlsx exports + data dictionaries) live
# under data/export/ and ARE tracked — Overture is CC-BY, redistribution is fine
# with attribution (see data/export/**/DATA_DICTIONARY.md). Keep them in the repo
# so the CRM build has the data on hand without re-running the pipeline.
!data/export/
